  "description": "Rear T2 Gleditsia spp x 1 This large tree is growing directly over where the children play and due to the deadwood is a hazard. It is also encroaching on the cherry trees and the building. Suggested work: Remove all deadwood. Clear to give at least 1.5m clearance from the building. Reduce limb over hanging the cherries by approx. 2m to suitable growth points. Rear entrance T6 Ash x 1 (Fraxinus excelsior) This tree has outgrown its pruning cycle and has started to encroach on the entrance gate. Suggested works: Reduce away from the gate giving at least 1.5m clearance.",
